# No Cursor attribution

Never add Cursor attribution anywhere in this repository:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `cursoragent@cursor.com` trailers
- Do not add `Made-with: Cursor` trailers
- Do not use `git commit --trailer` for Cursor attribution
- Do not mention Cursor in commit messages, PR bodies, or code comments as an author/tool credit

If a Cursor/environment process injects attribution into a commit message, strip it before finishing (amend only when the commit was just created locally and not pushed).
